{
 "$schema": "_plan.schema.json",
 "format": "plx-investigate-plan/v1",
 "id": "landed_cost",
 "families": [
  "F7"
 ],
 "title": "Landed cost of a purchase order, line by line, with every unknown visible",
 "description": "Goods, freight and duty of any purchase order from projected cited values, computed by the one landed-cost engine (operating/landed_cost.py: po_line_landed, assess_freight_quote, compute_landed_cost). Goods: each line's cited unit price per its cited unit times its ordered quantity; a $0.000 line takes the cited amount of the proforma naming the PO (a lead) when it is that line's alone; differing proformas: PI_VERSION_UNRESOLVED; an unread amount: PI_AMOUNT_UNREAD; none picked. Freight: the Portal's allocatePoFreightPerUnit (plx-customer-portal@6e76a5b portal/src/lib/costing/project-landed-quote.ts:915-941, byte-identical to the golden pin 5724575) of the header shipping estimate over a fully received purchase order, or the receipt's posted actual; every freight step names its basis. Each forwarder quote naming the PO (a lead) is its own entry: its stated total is never multiplied, a per-container rate only by a cited container count; total freight only when its cited scope covers origin, main carriage and destination, it is valid on the as-of date and, priced per container, the count is cited; a destination-only, tax-excluded or expired quote stays a typed gap, and a header estimate equal to such a quote is not allocated. Duty: only a receipt actual or a cited rate; the ontology projects an HS code but no duty rate, so duty is HS_CODE_NOT_CITED or DUTY_RATE_SOURCE_ABSENT. Stages (LOG-09): counts of the confirmations, forwarder quotes, receipts, purchase invoices, vendor payments and G/L entries the walk reached, one count per binding; a stage nothing reached is not counted as zero. Packaging: cases per line from the item's units per case (differing records: UNITS_PER_CASE_CONFLICT); case dimensions (app_product_pack_spec) are not served, so no container count is derived. Two currencies, an unknown price denominator, an unreceived line or a missing estimate leave that line and the total null, typed. Every record is an analytic estimate, not item cost (ERP-D-015).",
 "root": {
  "object_types": [
   "PurchaseOrder"
  ],
  "fallback_filters": [
   {
    "object_type": "PurchaseOrder",
    "property": "po_number"
   }
  ]
 },
 "step_budget": 128,
 "max_each": 50,
 "steps": [
  {
   "id": "root_read",
   "tool": "plx.object",
   "from": "root",
   "bind": "object_id"
  },
  {
   "id": "twins",
   "tool": "plx.around",
   "from": "root",
   "bind": "from",
   "args": {
    "path": [
     {
      "link_type": "PurchaseOrder.same_record_as",
      "direction": "forward"
     }
    ],
    "limit": 50
   },
   "retry": {
    "on_gap_reasons": [
     "below_tier_floor"
    ],
    "set_args": {
     "tier_floor": "lead"
    },
    "note_gap": "lead_tier_links_followed"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "twin_read",
   "tool": "plx.object",
   "from": "twins",
   "bind": "object_id"
  },
  {
   "id": "lines",
   "tool": "plx.around",
   "from": "root",
   "bind": "from",
   "args": {
    "path": [
     {
      "link_type": "PurchaseOrderLine.line_of",
      "direction": "reverse"
     }
    ],
    "limit": 50
   },
   "retry": {
    "on_gap_reasons": [
     "below_tier_floor"
    ],
    "set_args": {
     "tier_floor": "lead"
    },
    "note_gap": "lead_tier_links_followed"
   },
   "required": true
  },
  {
   "id": "line_read",
   "tool": "plx.object",
   "from": "lines",
   "bind": "object_id",
   "required": true
  },
  {
   "id": "items",
   "tool": "plx.around",
   "from": "lines",
   "bind": "from",
   "args": {
    "path": [
     {
      "link_type": "PurchaseOrderLine.for_item",
      "direction": "forward"
     }
    ],
    "limit": 50
   },
   "retry": {
    "on_gap_reasons": [
     "below_tier_floor"
    ],
    "set_args": {
     "tier_floor": "lead"
    },
    "note_gap": "lead_tier_links_followed"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "item_read",
   "tool": "plx.object",
   "from": "items",
   "bind": "object_id"
  },
  {
   "id": "item_twins",
   "tool": "plx.around",
   "from": "items",
   "bind": "from",
   "args": {
    "path": [
     {
      "link_type": "Product.same_record_as",
      "direction": "forward"
     }
    ],
    "limit": 50
   },
   "description": "The same item's other records (FileMaker), whose units per case may disagree with the Portal's.",
   "retry": {
    "on_gap_reasons": [
     "below_tier_floor"
    ],
    "set_args": {
     "tier_floor": "lead"
    },
    "note_gap": "lead_tier_links_followed"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "item_twin_read",
   "tool": "plx.object",
   "from": "item_twins",
   "bind": "object_id"
  },
  {
   "id": "receipts",
   "tool": "plx.around",
   "from": "root",
   "bind": "from",
   "args": {
    "path": [
     {
      "link_type": "Receipt.receives",
      "direction": "reverse"
     }
    ],
    "limit": 50
   },
   "retry": {
    "on_gap_reasons": [
     "below_tier_floor"
    ],
    "set_args": {
     "tier_floor": "lead"
    },
    "note_gap": "lead_tier_links_followed"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "receipt_read",
   "tool": "plx.object",
   "from": "receipts",
   "bind": "object_id"
  },
  {
   "id": "quotes",
   "tool": "plx.around",
   "from": "root",
   "bind": "from",
   "args": {
    "path": [
     {
      "link_type": "ForwarderQuote.for_purchase_order",
      "direction": "reverse"
     }
    ],
    "limit": 50
   },
   "retry": {
    "on_gap_reasons": [
     "below_tier_floor"
    ],
    "set_args": {
     "tier_floor": "lead"
    },
    "note_gap": "lead_tier_links_followed"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "quote_read",
   "tool": "plx.object",
   "from": "quotes",
   "bind": "object_id"
  },
  {
   "id": "confirmations",
   "tool": "plx.around",
   "from": "root",
   "bind": "from",
   "args": {
    "path": [
     {
      "link_type": "SupplierConfirmation.confirms",
      "direction": "reverse"
     }
    ],
    "limit": 50
   },
   "description": "Stage: the supplier's confirmation / proforma invoice naming the purchase order (a lead).",
   "retry": {
    "on_gap_reasons": [
     "below_tier_floor"
    ],
    "set_args": {
     "tier_floor": "lead"
    },
    "note_gap": "lead_tier_links_followed"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "confirmation_read",
   "tool": "plx.object",
   "from": "confirmations",
   "bind": "object_id"
  },
  {
   "id": "invoices",
   "tool": "plx.around",
   "from": "root",
   "bind": "from",
   "args": {
    "path": [
     {
      "link_type": "PurchaseInvoice.invoices",
      "direction": "reverse"
     }
    ],
    "limit": 50
   },
   "description": "Stage: the supplier's posted purchase invoices of the purchase order."
  },
  {
   "id": "payments",
   "tool": "plx.around",
   "from": "invoices",
   "bind": "from",
   "args": {
    "path": [
     {
      "link_type": "Payment.applies_to_purchase_invoice",
      "direction": "reverse"
     }
    ],
    "limit": 50
   },
   "description": "Stage: deposits and payments applied to those invoices (BC payment journal lines; posted payments are not served)."
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_entries",
   "tool": "plx.around",
   "from": "invoices",
   "bind": "from",
   "args": {
    "path": [
     {
      "link_type": "GeneralLedgerEntry.for_purchase_invoice",
      "direction": "reverse"
     }
    ],
    "limit": 50
   },
   "description": "Stage: the G/L entries those invoices posted."
  }
 ],
